    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">septentrĭōnālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		septentriones, II., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the
				north</i>, <i>northern</i>, <i>north-</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pars (terrae), circulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1</span></i>
			. 2, 4; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9, 6</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plaga,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 4, 5, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5, 16, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 70, 70, § 177</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oceanus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					17, 30, § 64</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 21</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sep-tentrĭōnālĭa</span></b> ,
				ĭum, n., <i>the northern regions</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11,
				14, 14, § 33</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Africae et Numidiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					34, 39, § 213</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Britanniae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. Agr.
					10</span></i>
			.</div>
